    <mxCell id="f6" value="&lt;b&gt;delivery.events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#047857&quot;&gt;owner: Delivery&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#047857&quot;&gt;key: brand_id:delivery_id&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#047857&quot;&gt;7 days, 12 partitions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#047857&quot;&gt;carries: dispatched, rider_assigned, picked_up, delivered, failed, cancelled&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#059669;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="1440" y="332" width="224" height="230" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n1" value="Not topics: &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;service&amp;gt;.dlq&lt;/b&gt; (one per consuming service, operations only). A wallet spend, a charge, a refund, OTP and every read are gRPC because someone is waiting (D-09). Candidates such as customer.changed, order.payload.captured and audit.events are not registered and are never drawn as topics (page 6)." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="600" width="1650" height="80" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
